{
  "id": "RAW_856d1bcc9a",
  "title": "CrowdStrike 洽谈收购 Zscaler，望跻身史上最大网络安全交易",
  "url": "https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MjM5NjA0NjgyMA==&mid=2651351526&idx=1&sn=9a508969631af85b9579d6b1cc80dc21",
  "date": "2026-11-22 18:48:00",
  "author": "FreeBuf",
  "siteName": "FreeBuf",
  "content": "<html>\n <head></head>\n <body>\n  <p><span>FreeBuf</span> <span>2026-11-22 18:48</span> <span style=\"display: inline-block;\">上海</span></p>\n  <p><img src=\"https://media.bestblogs.dev/20261122150257_e4d0521.jpeg\"></p>\n  <p>该交易有望跻身网络安全史上最大交易之一。</p>\n  <p style=\"margin:0 16px;\" nodeleaf=\"\"><img data-aistatus=\"1\" alt=\"FreeBuf\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"0.1328125\" data-w=\"640\" style=\"display:block;margin:0 auto;max-width:100%;width:100%;\" data-backw=\"546\" data-backh=\"73\" src=\"https://media.bestblogs.dev/20261122150257_45f4ab7.gif\"></p>\n  <p style=\"text-align: center;margin-left: 16px;margin-right: 16px;\" nodeleaf=\"\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img js_insertlocalimg\" data-aistatus=\"1\" data-backh=\"842\" data-backw=\"578\" data-imgfileid=\"503867877\" data-ratio=\"1.456273764258555\" data-s=\"300,640\" type=\"block\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"1052\" style=\"width:100%;\" src=\"https://media.bestblogs.dev/20261122150257_2d71418.png\"></p>\n  <div style=\"font-size: 16px;line-height: 1.75;letter-spacing: 1px;margin-bottom: 0px;\">\n   <p style=\"font-size:16px;color:#3E3E3E;line-height:1.75;letter-spacing:1px;text-align:justify;margin:0;padding:0 16px;text-indent:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">CrowdStrike正洽谈收购Zscaler，交易规模有望跻身网络安全史上最大交易之列。彭博社于11月20日周五率先援引两名知情人士的消息报道了本次洽谈，称相关谈判仍在进行中。</span></p>\n   <p style=\"font-size:16px;color:#3E3E3E;line-height:1.75;letter-spacing:1px;text-align:justify;margin:0;padding:0 16px;text-indent:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">本次谈判仍有可能最终无法达成协议。目前两家公司均未正式官宣交易，也未披露拟议收购价格。</span></p>\n   <p style=\"font-size:16px;color:#3E3E3E;line-height:1.75;letter-spacing:1px;text-align:justify;margin:0;padding:0 16px;text-indent:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">周五盘后交易时段，Zscaler股价大涨18%，CrowdStrike股价则下跌超8%。CrowdStrike拒绝置评，Zscaler也未第一时间回应CNBC的置评请求。</span></p>\n   <p style=\"font-size:16px;color:#3E3E3E;line-height:1.75;letter-spacing:1px;text-align:justify;margin:0;padding:0 16px;text-indent:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">周五常规交易收盘时，Zscaler市值约为320亿美元。这一数字仅代表股市估值，不代表CrowdStrike已提出的报价，也不代表最终可能支付的收购金额。</span></p>\n   <p style=\"font-size:18px;font-weight:bold;text-align:right;color:#000000;margin:0 0 4px 0;padding:0 16px;\"><span leaf=\"\">Part</span><span style=\"color:#00af00;\"><span leaf=\"\">01</span></span></p>\n   <p style=\"font-size:20px;font-weight:bold;text-align:right;color:#00af00;margin:0;padding:0 16px;\"><span leaf=\"\">收购Zscaler补强Falcon平台</span></p>\n   <p style=\"font-size:20px;font-weight:bold;text-align:right;color:#00af00;margin:0;padding:0 16px;\"><span leaf=\"\">补全访问控制能力</span></p>\n   <p style=\"font-size:16px;color:#3E3E3E;line-height:1.75;letter-spacing:1px;text-align:justify;margin:0;padding:0 16px;text-indent:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">CrowdStrike的Falcon平台主要帮助安全团队检测、阻断笔记本、服务器及云工作负载上的威胁。Zscaler的核心能力是管控用户、设备访问应用与连接互联网的路径。</span></p>\n   <p style=\"font-size:16px;color:#3E3E3E;line-height:1.75;letter-spacing:1px;text-align:justify;margin:0;padding:0 16px;text-indent:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">Zscaler的零信任交换平台（Zero Trust Exchange）会在放行访问请求前，核验用户身份及其他风险信号。两款产品解决的是同一安全问题的不同环节：Falcon负责发现可疑活动，Zscaler负责限制用户或设备的可访问范围。</span></p>\n   <p style=\"font-size:16px;color:#3E3E3E;line-height:1.75;letter-spacing:1px;text-align:justify;margin:0;padding:0 16px;text-indent:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">两家公司此前已有深度合作。收购消息曝出的前一天，CrowdStrike刚预告了一项新集成功能：Falcon可通过开放标准，将用户风险变化数据同步给Zscaler的自适应访问引擎（Adaptive Access Engine）。</span></p>\n   <p style=\"font-size:16px;color:#3E3E3E;line-height:1.75;letter-spacing:1px;text-align:justify;margin:0;padding:0 16px;text-indent:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">举例来说，如果用户登录后Falcon判定其存在风险，Zscaler可直接利用这一信号收紧访问权限，无需用户重新登录。这项功能基于今年9月宣布的合作扩展项目开发，与本次曝出的收购谈判没有关联。</span></p>\n   <p style=\"font-size:16px;color:#3E3E3E;line-height:1.75;letter-spacing:1px;text-align:justify;margin:0;padding:0 16px;text-indent:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">CrowdStrike此前收购SGNL的协议，也聚焦于根据风险动态调整访问权限，而非让权限持续有效直到被手动移除。如果成功收购Zscaler，CrowdStrike将进一步整合能力，把私有应用与公网访问的云管理服务纳入Falcon同一体系下。目前两家公司均未公布任何产品整合或调整客户合同的计划。</span></p>\n   <p style=\"font-size:18px;font-weight:bold;text-align:right;color:#000000;margin:0 0 4px 0;padding:0 16px;\"><span leaf=\"\">Part</span><span style=\"color:#00af00;\"><span leaf=\"\">02</span></span></p>\n   <p style=\"font-size:20px;font-weight:bold;text-align:right;color:#00af00;margin:0;padding:0 16px;\"><span leaf=\"\">行业大额收购频现</span></p>\n   <p style=\"font-size:20px;font-weight:bold;text-align:right;color:#00af00;margin:0;padding:0 16px;\"><span leaf=\"\">厂商加速拓展产品边界</span></p>\n   <p style=\"font-size:16px;color:#3E3E3E;line-height:1.75;letter-spacing:1px;text-align:justify;margin:0;padding:0 16px;text-indent:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">本次谈判正值头部网络安全厂商纷纷通过收购，拓展核心产品之外的能力覆盖。2026年3月，谷歌完成对Wiz的320亿美元收购，为谷歌云补充了云安全工具矩阵。今年早些时候，派拓网络（Palo Alto Networks）完成对CyberArk的250亿美元收购，将高权限系统账户的防护工具纳入产品线。</span></p>\n   <p style=\"font-size:16px;color:#3E3E3E;line-height:1.75;letter-spacing:1px;text-align:justify;margin:0;padding:0 16px;text-indent:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">上述两笔交易均已完成交割。Zscaler的当前市值足以体现本次CrowdStrike谈判的重要性，但目前还不能以此估算本次收购的最终规模，更无法提前确定其在行业交易规模中的排名。</span></p>\n   <p style=\"font-size:18px;font-weight:bold;text-align:right;color:#000000;margin:0 0 4px 0;padding:0 16px;\"><span leaf=\"\">Part</span><span style=\"color:#00af00;\"><span leaf=\"\">03</span></span></p>\n   <p style=\"font-size:20px;font-weight:bold;text-align:right;color:#00af00;margin:0;padding:0 16px;\"><span leaf=\"\">合并影响尚不明朗</span></p>\n   <p style=\"font-size:20px;font-weight:bold;text-align:right;color:#00af00;margin:0;padding:0 16px;\"><span leaf=\"\">客户关注兼容性与定价</span></p>\n   <p style=\"font-size:16px;color:#3E3E3E;line-height:1.75;letter-spacing:1px;text-align:justify;margin:0;padding:0 16px;text-indent:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">对企业安全团队而言，最实际的问题是，若两家公司完成合并，是否能让分析师无需切换工具，就完成告警调查、访问限制的全流程操作，提升运营效率。</span></p>\n   <p style=\"font-size:16px;color:#3E3E3E;line-height:1.75;letter-spacing:1px;text-align:justify;margin:0;padding:0 16px;text-indent:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">仅使用其中一家产品的客户，也会关心现有与其他厂商产品的集成对接是否会继续获得支持，以及相关服务定价是否会发生调整。</span></p>\n   <p style=\"font-size:16px;color:#3E3E3E;line-height:1.75;letter-spacing:1px;text-align:justify;margin:0;padding:0 16px;text-indent:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">就目前而言，双方现有的合作仅能证明两款产品可以实现协同，无法向客户预示合并后的公司将如何制定销售政策、提供技术支持服务。</span></p>\n  </div>\n  <div style=\"margin:0 16px;padding:12px 16px;border-left:3px solid #cccccc;background:#f9f9f9;\">\n   <p style=\"font-size:12px;color:#888888;margin:0 0 8px 0;line-height:1.6;font-weight:bold;text-align:left;\"><span leaf=\"\">参考来源：</span></p>\n   <p style=\"font-size:12px;color:#888888;margin:0 0 4px 0;line-height:1.6;font-weight:bold;\"><span leaf=\"\">CrowdStrike in Talks to Acquire Zscaler in One of the Biggest Cybersecurity Deals Ever</span></p>\n   <p style=\"font-size:12px;color:#888888;margin:0;line-height:1.6;word-break:break-all;\"><span leaf=\"\"><a href=\"https://cybersecuritynews.com/crowdstrike-to-acquire-zscaler/\" target=\"_blank\">https://cybersecuritynews.com/crowdstrike-to-acquire-zscaler/</a></span></p>\n  </div>\n  <div data-v-54ed4ede=\"\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box;margin: 0px;padding: 15px 0px 0px;border: 0px;text-decoration: none;font-style: normal;font-variant-ligatures: normal;font-variant-caps: normal;font-variant-numeric: inherit;font-variant-east-asian: inherit;font-variant-alternates: inherit;font-variant-position: inherit;font-variant-emoji: inherit;font-weight: 400;font-stretch: inherit;font-size: medium;line-height: inherit;font-optical-sizing: inherit;font-size-adjust: inherit;font-kerning: inherit;font-feature-settings: inherit;font-variation-settings: inherit;font-language-override: inherit;vertical-align: baseline;font-family: 微软雅黑, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, &quot;WenQuanYi Micro Hei&quot;, PingFangSC;outline: none;color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.65);letter-spacing: normal;orphans: 2;text-align: start;text-indent: 0px;text-transform: none;widows: 2;word-spacing: 0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;white-space: normal;\" data-pm-slice=\"6 2 []\">\n   <div data-pm-slice=\"4 2 []\" style=\"margin-top: 0px;margin-bottom: 0px;padding: 0px;display: block;box-sizing: border-box;max-width: 100%;color: rgb(53, 53, 53);font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, 黑体, Arial, sans-serif;font-size: 17px;font-style: normal;font-variant-ligatures: normal;font-variant-caps: normal;font-weight: 400;letter-spacing: normal;orphans: 2;text-align: start;text-indent: 0px;text-transform: none;widows: 2;word-spacing: 0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;white-space: normal;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);text-decoration-thickness: initial;text-decoration-style: initial;text-decoration-color: initial;pointer-events: initial;\">\n    <div data-pm-slice=\"7 2 [&quot;para&quot;,{&quot;tagName&quot;:&quot;section&quot;,&quot;attributes&quot;:{&quot;data-pm-slice&quot;:&quot;6 1 []&quot;},&quot;namespaceURI&quot;:&quot;http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml&quot;},&quot;para&quot;,{&quot;tagName&quot;:&quot;section&quot;,&quot;attributes&quot;:{&quot;data-pm-slice&quot;:&quot;2 1 []&quot;},&quot;namespaceURI&quot;:&quot;http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml&quot;}]\">\n     <div>\n      <div style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;font-family: &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;font-style: normal;font-variant-ligatures: normal;font-variant-caps: normal;font-weight: 400;letter-spacing: 0.544px;orphans: 2;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0px;text-transform: none;widows: 2;word-spacing: 0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;white-space: normal;text-decoration-thickness: initial;text-decoration-style: initial;text-decoration-color: initial;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);font-size: 16px;color: rgb(62, 62, 62);visibility: visible;\" data-pm-slice=\"22 1 []\">\n       <div style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;font-family: &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;font-style: normal;font-variant-ligatures: normal;font-variant-caps: normal;font-weight: 400;letter-spacing: 0.544px;orphans: 2;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0px;text-transform: none;widows: 2;word-spacing: 0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;white-space: normal;text-decoration-thickness: initial;text-decoration-style: initial;text-decoration-color: initial;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);font-size: 16px;color: rgb(62, 62, 62);visibility: visible;\" data-pm-slice=\"21 2 [&quot;para&quot;,{&quot;tagName&quot;:&quot;section&quot;,&quot;attributes&quot;:{&quot;style&quot;:&quot;-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;font-family: \\&quot;PingFang SC\\&quot;, system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \\&quot;Helvetica Neue\\&quot;, \\&quot;Hiragino Sans GB\\&quot;, \\&quot;Microsoft YaHei UI\\&quot;, \\&quot;Microsoft YaHei\\&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;font-style: normal;font-variant-ligatures: normal;font-variant-caps: normal;font-weight: 400;letter-spacing: 0.544px;orphans: 2;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0px;text-transform: none;widows: 2;word-spacing: 0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;white-space: normal;text-decoration-thickness: initial;text-decoration-style: initial;text-decoration-color: initial;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);font-size: 16px;color: rgb(62, 62, 62);visibility: visible;&quot;},&quot;namespaceURI&quot;:&quot;http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml&quot;,&quot;data-layout-id&quot;:null}]\">\n        <div data-pm-slice=\"5 3 [&quot;para&quot;,{&quot;tagName&quot;:&quot;section&quot;,&quot;attributes&quot;:{&quot;data-pm-slice&quot;:&quot;8 1 []&quot;,&quot;style&quot;:&quot;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;display: block;box-sizing: border-box;max-width: 100%;pointer-events: initial;&quot;},&quot;namespaceURI&quot;:&quot;http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml&quot;},&quot;para&quot;,{&quot;tagName&quot;:&quot;section&quot;,&quot;attributes&quot;:{&quot;data-pm-slice&quot;:&quot;9 1 []&quot;,&quot;style&quot;:&quot;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;display: block;box-sizing: border-box;max-width: 100%;pointer-events: initial;&quot;},&quot;namespaceURI&quot;:&quot;http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml&quot;},&quot;para&quot;,{&quot;tagName&quot;:&quot;section&quot;,&quot;attributes&quot;:{&quot;data-pm-slice&quot;:&quot;2 1 []&quot;,&quot;style&quot;:&quot;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;display: block;box-sizing: border-box;max-width: 100%;pointer-events: initial;&quot;},&quot;namespaceURI&quot;:&quot;http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml&quot;}]\" style=\"margin: 0px;padding: 0px;display: block;box-sizing: border-box;max-width: 100%;pointer-events: initial;text-align: right;\">\n         <div data-pm-slice=\"16 1 []\" style=\"margin: 0px;padding: 0px;display: block;box-sizing: border-box;max-width: 100%;color: rgb(53, 53, 53);font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, 黑体, Arial, sans-serif;font-size: 17px;font-style: normal;font-variant-ligatures: normal;font-variant-caps: normal;font-weight: 400;letter-spacing: normal;orphans: 2;text-align: start;text-indent: 0px;text-transform: none;widows: 2;word-spacing: 0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;white-space: normal;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);text-decoration-thickness: initial;text-decoration-style: initial;text-decoration-color: initial;pointer-events: initial;\">\n          <div style=\"box-sizing: border-box;font-style: normal;font-weight: 400;text-align: justify;font-size: 16px;color: rgb(62, 62, 62);\">\n           <d